{"id":"n26023-1-7","stage":5,"title":"중년 · 中年","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26023-1-7-1","ko":"중년 남성에게 어울릴 만한 모자를 찾고 있는데요.","zh":"我正在找适合中年男性的帽子。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"중년","meaning":"中年","explanation":"중년：中年","readings":[{"term":"중년","audio":"/audio/0d784807ea26f86950da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26023","senseId":"1","lemma":"중년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"남성에게","meaning":"男性","explanation":"남성：男性；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"남성","audio":"/audio/5b2251821e024ec965cb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28806","senseId":"1","lemma":"남성","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어울릴","meaning":"谐调，相配，般配","explanation":"어울리다：谐调，相配，般配；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"어울리다","audio":"/audio/e3eff4fbd4afe320fdac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67048","senseId":"4","lemma":"어울리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만한","meaning":"能","explanation":"만하다：能；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"만하다","audio":"/audio/d24817e6ba3f40d7ae8f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53017","senseId":"2","lemma":"만하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모자를","meaning":"帽子","explanation":"모자：帽子；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"모자","audio":"/audio/4bf2a7500031422684ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69297","senseId":"1","lemma":"모자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"찾고","meaning":"寻，觅，访，寻找，查","explanation":"찾다：寻，觅，访，寻找，查；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"찾다","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57320","senseId":"1","lemma":"찾다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는데요.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"0d784807ea26f869","term":"중년","zh":"中年","audio":"/audio/0d784807ea26f86950da.mp3","entryId":"26023","definition":"指四十前后的年龄；或指该年龄段的人。","pronunciation":["중년"]},{"id":"5b2251821e024ec9","term":"남성","zh":"男性","audio":"/audio/5b2251821e024ec965cb.mp3","entryId":"28806","definition":"不能生育孩子的性别；或指该性别的成年人。","pronunciation":["남성"]},{"id":"e3eff4fbd4afe320","term":"어울리다","zh":"谐调，相配，般配","audio":"/audio/e3eff4fbd4afe320fdac.mp3","entryId":"67048","definition":"相互自然地达到和谐。","pronunciation":["어울리다"]},{"id":"d24817e6ba3f40d7","term":"만하다","zh":"能","audio":"/audio/d24817e6ba3f40d7ae8f.mp3","entryId":"53017","definition":"表示前面内容所指的行动可以做到。","pronunciation":["만하다"]},{"id":"4bf2a75000314226","term":"모자","zh":"帽子","audio":"/audio/4bf2a7500031422684ab.mp3","entryId":"69297","definition":"戴在头上以表示礼貌或阻挡严寒暑热等的东西。","pronunciation":["모자"]},{"id":"0aa19509314fd879","term":"찾다","zh":"寻，觅，访，寻找，查","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3","entryId":"57320","definition":"为了得到某物或为了见某人而四处查找；或指得到此物或见此人。","pronunciation":["찯따"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c1724004584d67aaf80e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26023-1-7-2","ko":"이건 어떠세요?","zh":"这个怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이건","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이거：这个；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"이거","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71128","senseId":"1","lemma":"이거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떠세요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；으세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4515223b0fb4ed4e","term":"이거","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3","entryId":"71128","definition":"指代与说话人较近的、或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이거"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/9eb2e75fa72d46eda1cf.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.369,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=26023","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":162,"sequenceScore":3.1957,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这个怎么样？","我正在找适合中年男性的帽子。","敏俊即使干脏活累活，也总是面带笑容。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我正在找适合中年男性的帽子。","敏俊即使干脏活累活，也总是面带笑容。","这个怎么样？"],"answer":2}]}
